{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a454ee45-cb73-83dd-af17-4105f60bc213",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T16:16:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paula Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:10:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. The storm drain at the corner by 162 Admiral Kalbfus Road is frozen shut and water is spread across the whole intersection."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:14-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 162 Admiral Kalbfus Road, that's up in the North End. Let me make sure I have it right. The grate on the drain is frozen over, and the water can't get down, so it's pooling out into the intersection. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And how deep are we talking? Is it just a big puddle, or is it more than that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's about up to the hubcaps. Cars are creeping through it, and one just stalled out a minute ago and then got going again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:11:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's deep. Hubcaps. And I'm guessing it's not from rain, since we haven't had any."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there's no storm. It's been dry for days. It's been like this on and off, the drain just doesn't take anything. Whatever melts off the snowbanks runs down and sits there and freezes at night. This is the third time I've had to call about this corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's frustrating when it keeps coming back. Let me put this in as a drainage problem with a frozen grate, flooded intersection, water about hubcap high. Is it on the corner itself, or mid-street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:12:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner. Right where the two streets meet, on the side by my building. I'm renting here, so I can't do anything about the drain myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:12:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, and you shouldn't be out there chipping at it near traffic anyway. Did you want to give me a number in case the crew needs to reach someone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:13:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0175. Name on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paula Souza. S-O-U-Z-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:13:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Paula Souza. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:13:21-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when is somebody going to come out? It's four o'clock on a Monday and it's going to freeze solid again tonight. Do the crews work on weekends? Because if nobody gets here before then, that's a lot of ice sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:13:40-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do have people on for the weekend when something like this is a hazard, but it's Monday, so my hope is it gets looked at sooner than that. I'm marking it as a flooded intersection with ice, which gets it flagged ahead of a regular drain request. I'd say sometime tomorrow is the realistic window, maybe this evening if they're nearby."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:14:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Okay. And if somebody hits that water and slides?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:14:13-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it gets dangerous before they arrive, like cars stalling or sliding, call the police non-emergency line so they can put out a cone or reroute. I'll note on the ticket that cars are already stalling there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Please put that in. It's been going on long enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:14:36-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm typing it in now. Frozen grate, no storm, dry-weather problem, repeat caller, cars stalling. Anything else about it, like is there a hydrant or a catch basin on the other side that might be doing anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:14:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's another grate across the street but it's buried in snow. I can't tell if it's working. It looks like the water isn't going toward it at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll add that there's a second grate across the way covered by snow. That helps them know where to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:15:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it still bright out where you are? It's getting pretty dark here already and I'm worried about people not seeing how deep it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:15:28-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's getting dusky here too, the sun's about gone. It's the shortest days of the year this week, so you're right, it's going to be dark soon. I'll mark it urgent for that reason, so drivers aren't going into it blind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That's what I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read it back. Paula Souza, 162 Admiral Kalbfus Road in the North End, frozen storm drain at the corner, water across the intersection about hubcap deep, no storm involved, callback 401-555-0175. Did I get it all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. If it's not moving by tomorrow midday, call back and give me the ticket again and I'll push it. Take care, Paula."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T16:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
